+//! newline-delimited JSON (`packages/contracts/src/desktopBrowser.ts`) to a
+//! Unix socket named by `T3GPUI_DESKTOP_BROWSER_SOCKET`, which this module
+//! connects to. A web view whose `injectedJavaScriptBeforeContentLoaded`
+//! holds `/*t3-desktop-browser {"threadId":..,"tabId":..}*/` is a bridge
